OL,3,GNEWSAFirst images of Brit North arts
OL,4,Acollege revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDesign images of the north of England's
OL,7,Ffirst Brit School-inspired performing
OL,8,Farts college have been revealed.
OL,10,FInspired by the world famous performing
OL,11,Farts academy in London, Brit North is
OL,12,Fset to be built in Bradford city centre
OL,13,Fafter the council sold the land to the
OL,14,FDepartment for Education in February.
OL,16,FThe plans were announced in 2023, with
OL,17,Fthe college housed on the site of the
OL,18,Fformer Jacob's Well council building `
OL,19,Fcurrently a car park.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
