OL,3,GNEWSAFirst images of Brit North arts
OL,4,Acollege revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to a planning application,
OL,7,FBradford's designation as UK City of
OL,8,FCulture 2025 was a key part in bringing
OL,9,Fthe school to the city, with hopes the
OL,10,Fproject will improve facilities for the
OL,11,Farts across the North of England.
